Z||000016||FieroKyleatSchool||10-31-2001||12:23 PM||||about 6 to 10, I see some pass through town that are from Grand Rapids sometimes. I have a friend who has a kit on his thats a GT. Then there is Fierowrecker that lives about 2 miles away from me that has 2 Fieros on his own self. We have a population of 8,000 may be. There are two kids that I go to school with that have 2m4s. The only other GTs I have seen in Lowell is a beat up 85 GT just like mine. I saw one 85 GT break down a McDonalds and I stopped to see if he needed help. Then yesterday I saw a red fastback GT with bumberstickers on the back go through. Then there is this one 2m4 I keep seeing thats yellow with black racing stripes with a Duster spoiler which I saw for sale at a used car lot in Grand Rapids. Not a bad looking car. I my way up on Manistee Monday, I say a beat up broke down black Fiero with the ground effects on 131 north of cedar springs. It was sad to see, had a tear in my eye for the fallen comrad. Looked like the 4 cycl.||||reg||1
